  "plan": "Probe for a package manager, network access, and any pre-existing PDP-11 emulator. If `apt`/network is available, install simh (provides pdp11). If not, I'll fall back to writing a PDP-11 emulator in Python that loads the a.out and emulates the few instructions + the write/exit syscalls needed for this C program. First, reconnaissance.",
